{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptive-bitrate","title":"自适应码率流媒体技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery/adaptive-bitrate","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"自适应码率流媒体技术\">自适应码率流媒体技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自适应码率（ABR）</strong>：将同一内容编码为多个质量档次，客户端根据实时网络与设备能力动态切换。</li>\n<li><strong>码率阶梯（Bitrate Ladder）</strong>：一组由低到高的编码档次，是 ABR 决策的可选空间。</li>\n<li><strong>清单文件（Manifest）</strong>：如 <code>.m3u8</code>（HLS）或 <code>.mpd</code>（DASH），声明所有可用档次与分片位置。</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐量估计</strong>：客户端依据历史下载速率预测可用带宽，是码率决策的输入。</li>\n<li><strong>CMAF</strong>：基于 fMP4 的统一分片格式，使 HLS 与 DASH 可共用同一份分片。</li>\n<li><strong>QoE</strong>：起播时间、重缓冲率、平均码率与切换频率综合而成的用户体验度量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自适应码率的核心原理\">自适应码率的核心原理</h2><p>自适应码率（Adaptive Bitrate Streaming，ABR）是现代流媒体分发的基石技术。其核心思想是：将同一内容编码为多个质量档次（Bitrate Ladder），客户端根据实时网络状况和设备能力动态切换最合适的档次，在画质和流畅性之间寻求最优平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;编码端(服务器)&quot;&#10;        SRC[源视频 4K Master] --&gt; ENC1[编码档次 1: 1080p 8Mbps]&#10;        SRC --&gt; ENC2[编码档次 2: 1080p 4.5Mbps]&#10;        SRC --&gt; ENC3[编码档次 3: 720p 2.5Mbps]&#10;        SRC --&gt; ENC4[编码档次 4: 480p 1Mbps]&#10;        SRC --&gt; ENC5[编码档次 5: 360p 400kbps]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;分片打包&quot;&#10;        ENC1 --&gt; SEG1[4s 分片 × N]&#10;        ENC2 --&gt; SEG2[4s 分片 × N]&#10;        ENC3 --&gt; SEG3[4s 分片 × N]&#10;        ENC4 --&gt; SEG4[4s 分片 × N]&#10;        ENC5 --&gt; SEG5[4s 分片 × N]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    MANIFEST[清单文件 .m3u8 / .mpd]&#10;    SEG1 --&gt; MANIFEST&#10;    SEG2 --&gt; MANIFEST&#10;    SEG3 --&gt; MANIFEST&#10;    SEG4 --&gt; MANIFEST&#10;    SEG5 --&gt; MANIFEST&#10;&#10;    MANIFEST --&gt; CLIENT[客户端播放器]\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"编码端(服务器)\"\n        SRC[源视频 4K Master] --&gt; ENC1[编码档次 1: 1080p 8Mbps]\n        SRC --&gt; ENC2[编码档次 2: 1080p 4.5Mbps]\n        SRC --&gt; ENC3[编码档次 3: 720p 2.5Mbps]\n        SRC --&gt; ENC4[编码档次 4: 480p 1Mbps]\n        SRC --&gt; ENC5[编码档次 5: 360p 400kbps]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"分片打包\"\n        ENC1 --&gt; SEG1[4s 分片 × N]\n        ENC2 --&gt; SEG2[4s 分片 × N]\n        ENC3 --&gt; SEG3[4s 分片 × N]\n        ENC4 --&gt; SEG4[4s 分片 × N]\n        ENC5 --&gt; SEG5[4s 分片 × N]\n    end\n\n    MANIFEST[清单文件 .m3u8 / .mpd]\n    SEG1 --&gt; MANIFEST\n    SEG2 --&gt; MANIFEST\n    SEG3 --&gt; MANIFEST\n    SEG4 --&gt; MANIFEST\n    SEG5 --&gt; MANIFEST\n\n    MANIFEST --&gt; CLIENT[客户端播放器]</pre><p>ABR 的关键创新在于将&quot;一次性传输&quot;变为&quot;逐片协商&quot;：每下载一个分片后，客户端都可以根据最新的网络反馈重新决策下一个分片的质量档次。这种细粒度的自适应能力是传统渐进式下载所不具备的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"abr-与传统下载的对比\">ABR 与传统下载的对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>渐进式下载</th>\n<th>ABR 流媒体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>码率固定性</td>\n<td>单一固定码率</td>\n<td>多档次动态切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络适应</td>\n<td>无（卡顿或缓冲）</td>\n<td>实时自适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起播速度</td>\n<td>慢（需缓冲大段）</td>\n<td>快（低档次快速起播）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 缓存效率</td>\n<td>高（单文件）</td>\n<td>中等（多分片）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观看体验</td>\n<td>要么流畅要么卡顿</td>\n<td>画质动态调整，极少卡顿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽利用率</td>\n<td>低（保守估计）</td>\n<td>高（充分利用可用带宽）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hls-协议详解\">HLS 协议详解</h2><h3 id=\"hls-架构\">HLS 架构</h3><p>HTTP Live Streaming（HLS）由 Apple 于 2009 年推出，是目前市场份额最大的自适应流媒体协议。HLS 完全基于 HTTP，因此天然兼容所有 CDN 和 Web 基础设施。</p>\n<p>HLS 的核心由两类文件组成：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Master Playlist</strong>：列出所有可用的质量档次</li>\n<li><strong>Media Playlist</strong>：每个档次的分片列表</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Master Playlist 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"#EXTM3U&#10;#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=8000000,RESOLUTION=1920x1080,CODECS=&quot;avc1.640028,mp4a.40.2&quot;&#10;1080p/playlist.m3u8&#10;#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=4500000,RESOLUTION=1280x720,CODECS=&quot;avc1.64001f,mp4a.40.2&quot;&#10;720p/playlist.m3u8&#10;#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=2500000,RESOLUTION=854x480,CODECS=&quot;avc1.4d401e,mp4a.40.2&quot;&#10;480p/playlist.m3u8\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#EXTM3U</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=8000000,RESOLUTION=1920x1080,CODECS=\"avc1.640028,mp4a.40.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1080p/playlist.m3u8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=4500000,RESOLUTION=1280x720,CODECS=\"avc1.64001f,mp4a.40.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>720p/playlist.m3u8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=2500000,RESOLUTION=854x480,CODECS=\"avc1.4d401e,mp4a.40.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>480p/playlist.m3u8</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hls-版本演进\">HLS 版本演进</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>HLS 版本</th>\n<th>发布年份</th>\n<th>关键特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HLS v1-v3</td>\n<td>2009-2011</td>\n<td>基础分段、MPEG-TS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLS v4</td>\n<td>2012</td>\n<td>I-Frame 播放列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLS v5</td>\n<td>2014</td>\n<td>加密密钥轮换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLS v6</td>\n<td>2016</td>\n<td>fMP4 分片支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLS v7</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>LL-HLS 基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLS v9+</td>\n<td>2020-2025</td>\n<td>LL-HLS 完善、CMAF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HLS 典型延迟</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HLS 典型延迟} = (N_{segments} \\times T_{segment}) + T_{encoding} + T_{transfer}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HLS </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">典型延迟</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>传统 HLS 使用 3 个 6 秒分片作为缓冲，延迟约 18-30 秒。LL-HLS 通过部分分片（Partial Segments）将延迟降至 2-5 秒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mpeg-dash-协议\">MPEG-DASH 协议</h2><h3 id=\"dash-架构\">DASH 架构</h3><p>MPEG-DASH（Dynamic Adaptive Streaming over HTTP）是 ISO 国际标准（ISO/IEC 23009-1），也是唯一的国际标准化 ABR 协议。与 Apple 私有的 HLS 不同，DASH 由 MPEG 组织制定，任何人都可以免费实现。</p>\n<p>DASH 使用 MPD（Media Presentation Description）作为清单文件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DASH 概念</th>\n<th>HLS 对应</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MPD</td>\n<td>Master Playlist</td>\n<td>内容描述文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Period</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>时间段（广告插入点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adaptation Set</td>\n<td>Stream</td>\n<td>一组可切换的表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Representation</td>\n<td>Variant Stream</td>\n<td>单一质量档次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Segment</td>\n<td>Segment</td>\n<td>媒体分片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"hls-vs-dash-技术对比\">HLS vs DASH 技术对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>HLS</th>\n<th>DASH</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准制定者</td>\n<td>Apple (私有)</td>\n<td>ISO/IEC (开放)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清单格式</td>\n<td>M3U8 (文本)</td>\n<td>MPD (XML)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片格式</td>\n<td>TS 或 fMP4</td>\n<td>fMP4 (CMAF)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DRM 支持</td>\n<td>FairPlay</td>\n<td>Widevine / PlayReady</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器原生播放</td>\n<td>Safari (iOS/macOS)</td>\n<td>需 MSE (Chrome/Firefox)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 兼容性</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低延迟方案</td>\n<td>LL-HLS</td>\n<td>LL-DASH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告插入</td>\n<td>SCTE-35</td>\n<td>Period + SCTE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备覆盖</td>\n<td>iOS 必须、全平台</td>\n<td>非 Apple 平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>实际选择</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>HLS</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 目标包含 iOS 用户</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>DASH</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 需要开放标准 + Widevine DRM</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>HLS + DASH (CMAF)</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 全平台覆盖</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{实际选择} = \\begin{cases}\n\\text{HLS} &amp; \\text{if 目标包含 iOS 用户} \\\\\n\\text{DASH} &amp; \\text{if 需要开放标准 + Widevine DRM} \\\\\n\\text{HLS + DASH (CMAF)} &amp; \\text{if 全平台覆盖}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际选择</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HLS</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DASH</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HLS + DASH (CMAF)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标包含</span><span class=\"mord\"> iOS </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用户</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需要开放标准</span><span class=\"mord\"> + Widevine DRM</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全平台覆盖</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"abr-算法原理\">ABR 算法原理</h2><h3 id=\"码率决策模型\">码率决策模型</h3><p>ABR 算法的核心任务是：在每个分片下载完成后，决定下一个分片应请求哪个质量档次。主流算法家族包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法类型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>决策依据</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吞吐量型</td>\n<td>Throughput-based</td>\n<td>历史带宽估计</td>\n<td>反应快</td>\n<td>波动大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲区型</td>\n<td>BBA (Buffer-Based)</td>\n<td>当前缓冲水位</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>反应慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合型</td>\n<td>BOLA, MPC</td>\n<td>吞吐量+缓冲区</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n<td>复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器学习型</td>\n<td>Pensieve, ABR-RL</td>\n<td>神经网络预测</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>训练成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"吞吐量估计\">吞吐量估计</h3><p>带宽估计通常使用指数移动平均（EMA）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{B}_{n} = \\alpha \\cdot T_n + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\hat{B}_{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1551em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片的实际下载吞吐量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是平滑系数（常用 0.2-0.5）。</p>\n<p>安全裕度（Safety Margin）确保不会过于激进：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{safe} = \\beta \\cdot \\hat{B}_n,\\quad \\beta \\in [0.6, 0.85]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1412em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"码率阶梯设计\">码率阶梯设计</h3><p>Bitrate Ladder 的设计直接影响 ABR 效果。Netflix 在 2015 年提出的 Per-Title Encoding 根据内容复杂度定制码率阶梯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>720p 码率</th>\n<th>1080p 码率</th>\n<th>4K 码率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动画/简单</td>\n<td>1.0 Mbps</td>\n<td>2.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>8 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通剧情</td>\n<td>2.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>4.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>15 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作/复杂</td>\n<td>4.0 Mbps</td>\n<td>8.0 Mbps</td>\n<td>25 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最优码率阶梯</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>切换频率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最优码率阶梯} = \\arg\\min \\sum_{i} \\left[ VMAF_i - VMAF_{target} \\right]^2 + \\lambda \\cdot \\text{切换频率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最优码率阶梯</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">切换频率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>截至 2026 年，主流平台（YouTube、Netflix、Disney+）都采用基于 VMAF（Video Multi-Method Assessment Fusion）的感知质量指标来优化编码参数，取代传统的固定 CRF 方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cmaf-统一格式\">CMAF 统一格式</h2><h3 id=\"common-media-application-format\">Common Media Application Format</h3><p>CMAF（ISO/IEC 23000-19）是 Apple 和 Microsoft 于 2017 年联合提出的统一分片格式，旨在解决 HLS 和 DASH 使用不同分片格式导致的存储冗余：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;CMAF 之前(双重存储)&quot;&#10;        SRC1[源视频] --&gt; HLS_ENC[HLS 编码]&#10;        SRC1 --&gt; DASH_ENC[DASH 编码]&#10;        HLS_ENC --&gt; TS[MPEG-TS 分片]&#10;        DASH_ENC --&gt; FMP4[fMP4 分片]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;CMAF 之后(统一存储)&quot;&#10;        SRC2[源视频] --&gt; CMAF_ENC[统一编码]&#10;        CMAF_ENC --&gt; CMAF_SEG[CMAF 分片 fMP4]&#10;        CMAF_SEG --&gt; HLS_M[HLS Manifest]&#10;        CMAF_SEG --&gt; DASH_M[DASH Manifest]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"CMAF 之前(双重存储)\"\n        SRC1[源视频] --&gt; HLS_ENC[HLS 编码]\n        SRC1 --&gt; DASH_ENC[DASH 编码]\n        HLS_ENC --&gt; TS[MPEG-TS 分片]\n        DASH_ENC --&gt; FMP4[fMP4 分片]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"CMAF 之后(统一存储)\"\n        SRC2[源视频] --&gt; CMAF_ENC[统一编码]\n        CMAF_ENC --&gt; CMAF_SEG[CMAF 分片 fMP4]\n        CMAF_SEG --&gt; HLS_M[HLS Manifest]\n        CMAF_SEG --&gt; DASH_M[DASH Manifest]\n    end</pre><p>CMAF 的核心约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容器：fMP4（ISO BMFF）</li>\n<li>视频编码：H.264 / H.265 / AV1</li>\n<li>音频编码：AAC / E-AC-3 / Opus</li>\n<li>分片对齐：所有档次的 IDR 帧必须在相同时间点</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CMAF 使得同一套编码分片可以同时通过 HLS 和 DASH 清单分发，CDN 存储空间节省约 50%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客户端播放器实现\">客户端播放器实现</h2><h3 id=\"media-source-extensions-mse\">Media Source Extensions (MSE)</h3><p>MSE 是 W3C 标准的浏览器 API，允许 JavaScript 直接向 HTML5 <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> 元素注入媒体数据。几乎所有基于 Web 的 ABR 播放器都依赖 MSE：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>播放器库</th>\n<th>协议支持</th>\n<th>许可证</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>hls.js</td>\n<td>HLS</td>\n<td>Apache-2.0</td>\n<td>轻量、广泛使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dash.js</td>\n<td>DASH</td>\n<td>BSD-3</td>\n<td>DASH 参考实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>shaka-player</td>\n<td>HLS + DASH</td>\n<td>Apache-2.0</td>\n<td>Google 维护、DRM 完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Video.js</td>\n<td>HLS + DASH</td>\n<td>Apache-2.0</td>\n<td>插件生态丰富</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MSE 的工作流程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Fetch 分片</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>ArrayBuffer</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>SourceBuffer.appendBuffer()</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>解码渲染</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Fetch 分片} \\rightarrow \\text{ArrayBuffer} \\rightarrow \\text{SourceBuffer.appendBuffer()} \\rightarrow \\text{解码渲染}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fetch </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分片</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ArrayBuffer</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SourceBuffer.appendBuffer()</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解码渲染</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"qoe-监控指标\">QoE 监控指标</h3><p>衡量 ABR 系统质量的关键指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起播时间 (Startup Time)</td>\n<td>点击播放到首帧显示</td>\n<td>&lt; 2s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重缓冲率 (Rebuffer Ratio)</td>\n<td>缓冲时间 / 播放时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均码率</td>\n<td>实际播放的加权平均码率</td>\n<td>接近可用带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>码率切换频率</td>\n<td>每分钟切换次数</td>\n<td>&lt; 2次/分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VMAF 平均分</td>\n<td>感知画质评分</td>\n<td>&gt; 80</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ABR 把流媒体从&quot;一次性传输&quot;变成&quot;逐片协商&quot;：编码端按码率阶梯产出多档次分片，客户端在每片下载后依据吞吐量估计重新决策，从而在画质与流畅性之间取得动态平衡。HLS 与 DASH 是两大主流协议，而基于 fMP4 的 CMAF 正在统一二者的分片格式；最终体验则由起播时间、重缓冲率、平均码率与切换频率等 QoE 指标共同衡量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>HLS（HTTP 兼容）/ DASH（开放）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片格式</td>\n<td>fMP4 / CMAF 统一化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策输入</td>\n<td>吞吐量估计 + 缓冲水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量目标</td>\n<td>QoE 四指标而非单一码率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应码率流媒体技术","id":"自适应码率流媒体技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应码率的核心原理","id":"自适应码率的核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"ABR 与传统下载的对比","id":"abr-与传统下载的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"HLS 协议详解","id":"hls-协议详解"},{"level":3,"text":"HLS 架构","id":"hls-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"HLS 版本演进","id":"hls-版本演进"},{"level":2,"text":"MPEG-DASH 协议","id":"mpeg-dash-协议"},{"level":3,"text":"DASH 架构","id":"dash-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"HLS vs DASH 技术对比","id":"hls-vs-dash-技术对比"},{"level":2,"text":"ABR 算法原理","id":"abr-算法原理"},{"level":3,"text":"码率决策模型","id":"码率决策模型"},{"level":3,"text":"吞吐量估计","id":"吞吐量估计"},{"level":3,"text":"码率阶梯设计","id":"码率阶梯设计"},{"level":2,"text":"CMAF 统一格式","id":"cmaf-统一格式"},{"level":3,"text":"Common Media Application Format","id":"common-media-application-format"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端播放器实现","id":"客户端播放器实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Media Source Extensions (MSE)","id":"media-source-extensions-mse"},{"level":3,"text":"QoE 监控指标","id":"qoe-监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"封装与流管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/muxing-streams"},"next":{"title":"CDN 加速与视频分发架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery/cdn"}}